# IT Inventory V3 Technical Handoff

## Modern Infrastructure
- **Auth**: Microsoft Graph API (OAuth2) replaces legacy EWS.
- **Database**: PostgreSQL (v15+) replaces local SQLite.
- **Frontend**: Custom Glassmorphism CSS theme built on Vanilla CSS.

## Configuration (.env)
- `AZURE_CLIENT_ID`, `TENANT_ID`, `CLIENT_SECRET`: Graph API credentials.
- `EXCHANGE_EMAIL`: `support@findtalent.net`.
- `DATABASE_URL`: `postgresql://dean:Eralp123!@192.168.1.186:5432/inventory`.
- `APP_BASE_URL`: Public access URL for approval links.

## Core Modules
- [email_watcher.py](file:///c:/projects/it-inventory/it-inventory/inventory_app/email_watcher.py): Background job for email polling.
- [email_parser.py](file:///c:/projects/it-inventory/it-inventory/inventory_app/email_parser.py): Regex-based personal data extractor.
- [notifier.py](file:///c:/projects/it-inventory/it-inventory/inventory_app/notifier.py): Teams / Email notification dispatcher.
- [graph_watcher.py](file:///c:/projects/it-inventory/it-inventory/inventory_app/graph_watcher.py): Graph API specific implementation.

